5256   BDBF             ;* Phrase Structure     
5257   BDBF             ;*		            
5258   BDBF             ;* First Byte non-negative = Speech Item, 2nd Byte is pitch delay > $00 (smaller values, shorter delay, higher pitch)
5259   BDBF             ;* First Byte negative     = Silence, 2nd byte is LSB of 2's complement value * 5us
5260   BDBF             ;* First Byte Zero	   = End of Phrase
5261   BDBF             ;*******************************************************************
