7030   FC39             ;* Master Command Lookup Table - This table contains two bytes
7031   FC39             ;* per command, the first byte is the controlling routine that
7032   FC39             ;* is called and the second byte is the register a data that
7033   FC39             ;* routine requires. The lookup starts with command 01 since 
7034   FC39             ;* command 00 does nothing.
7035   FC39             ;**************************************************************
